162	// launcher (launch_fused_mamba_megakernel<AdamW>, OUTSIDE the wgmma guard — this
163	// wgmma-token TU can still call it). For the step-time gate to time scalar and TC
164	// back-to-back in one process / one contention regime → an honest scalar:TC ratio.
165	// The scalar path uses its OWN workspace (nCTA*total partials + nCTA loss + 1).
